                                "text": "2003 March 22, Craig Sherborne, Footy′s Man of Passion, The Herald Sun, republished in 2003, Garrie Hutchinson (editor), The Best Australian Sports Writing 2003, page 79,\nDemetriou is an inveterate punter with a miraculous instinct for picking big quadrellas."
