                                "text": "2010, Stephen Barkoczy. Australian Tax Casebook, 10th Edition, CCH Australia, page 416,\nInstead, the taxpayer relied on his own intuition, placed bets mainly on the totalisator or with on-course bookmakers and was more inclined to place “higher risk” bets such as trifectas and quadrellas."
